# Patch: Sinkhole 31 CN Push / HTTPDNS / DCS Telemetry Domains in /system/etc/hosts (v7.3)
# Target Base Port: ColorOS 17 V6 CN (PLZ110_17.0.0.107(CN01), OnePlus 15T base) ported to Xiaomi 15 (dada, SM8750) / Stock HyperOS OS4.0.0.11 vendor base
# Target Path: /system/etc/hosts
# Notes: Prevents UID-1000 com.heytap.mcs (immune to UID-keyed OEM_DENY_3) and CN telemetry clients from opening stuck TCP retransmit queues (Send-Q > 0, ~3 pkts/s) that reset 5G Fast Dormancy and lock pa_therm0 up to 58.7C. Preserves App Market, Gallery AI, MyDevices, and OShare.
# Apply: patch -p1 < system_hosts_cn_telemetry_sinkhole.patch
#
